        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Elephant armor mountain is a rank eight immemorial immortal material of information path. Lang Ya land spirit processes over ten rank eight information path immortal materials, including that mountain, into a temporary multicolored whirlpool whose aura draws wisdom Gu. Legends say wisdom Gu’s recipe contains a large amount of information path immortal materials, and a wild wisdom Gu advances only in places full of information path dao marks.",
      "chapters": [
        1562
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wisdom-gu-lure",
